{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS IS A DEMO VERSION OF THE GAME, WHICH CONTAINS THE FIRST FEW LEVELS!</h2><br>John Fox is an elite warrior and super soldier who saved the leaders of various States. He was a professional mercenary who retired with honor. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512390/extras/co-op-b1.gif?t=1739554413\" /><br><br>But the evil big toad, decided to make an army of John Fox clones. <br>To lure the protagonist into the lab. The big toad's minions kill Milo, John's pet. <br>John Fox rushes in pursuit of the harmful toad and encounters an army of clone frogs, which flooded the entire city. <br><br>If the big toad manages to defeat John Fox, the world will be doomed to misery and chaos.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512390/extras/station5.gif?t=1739554413\" /><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D Pixel Beat 'em up<br></li><li>Variety of terrains and scenarios<br></li><li>Motorbike chases<br></li><li>Thrilling music<br></li><li>Boss battles</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512390/extras/bike2.gif?t=1739554413\" /><br><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512390?t=1739554413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739554413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512390/a5c67ed43694b234474bf9bf65d259b602c85690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739554413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512390/a5c67ed43694b234474bf9bf65d259b602c85690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739554413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Share